  "label": "The grieving man is mapped as the father experiencing the described tragedy",
  "description": "The text describes a man who is the father of a newborn daughter and has lost his wife during childbirth. The visual material shows an elderly man in extreme emotional distress, screaming in a ruined environment. The meme implicitly maps this man as the 'father' in the described scenario, using his visual portrayal of grief to represent the emotional state of the person described in the text. The mapping is established through the juxtaposition of the text and the image, where the man's anguish is used to symbolize the father's grief.",
